    Challenges in modern medicine
  </h1><div class="header-menu"><div class="search clearfix"><form class="form-wrapper cf" action="/en/journal/search/" method="get"><span><input type="text" name="query" placeholder="Site search..."></span><span><button type="submit">Search</button></span></form></div><div class="language"><span>Сhoose the language: </span><ul><li><a href="/journal/annotation/253/">Русский</a></li><li class="active">English</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="top_nav"><ul id="nav"><li><a href="#s1">About</a><span id="s1"></span><ul class="subs" id="forDocs"><li><a href="/">Home page</a></li><li><a href="/en/editorial-board/">Editorial board</a></li><li><a href="/en/info/journal/documents/">Legal documents</a></li><li><a href="/en/info/journal/editorial-ethics/">Editorial ethics</a></li><li><a href="/en/journal/authors/">
